ersity_official","source_published_at":"2021-03-26","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"JMU says the rock supports respectful expression; messages are not reservable and may be repainted at any time.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jmu-kissing-rock-legend","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Kissing Rock","title":"Test the Kissing Rock Marriage Legend","subtitle":"A Quad courtship myth rooted in the 1920s","notes":"Visit the limestone landmark and retell its marriage prediction; treat any kiss as optional and based on clear consent.","short_summary":"A leftover limestone outcrop carries JMU’s longest-lived romantic campus myth.","evidence_claim":"JMU’s Centennial Celebration history says couples once hid behind Kissing Rock and records the later legend that the person kissed there will become the kisser’s spouse, while noting no evidence of its accuracy.","source_url":"https://www.jmu.edu/centennialcelebration/rock.shtml","source_title":"JMU Centennial Celebration — The Rock","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-09-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"An outdoor landmark on the Quad; the marriage prediction is explicitly presented by JMU as an unverified legend.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
